| Page / Route | View Function | URL Name | Path |
|---|---|---|---|
| Landing / Home | `home` | `'home'` | `""` |
| Role Login | `login_view` | `'login'` | `"login/"` |
| OTP Sign-in | `signin_view` | `'signin'` | `"signin/"` |
| Marketplace | `marketplace_view` | `'marketplace'` | `"marketplace/"` |
| Checkout | `checkout_view` | `'checkout'` | `"checkout/"` |
| Farmer Dashboard | `farmer_dashboard_view` | `'farmer_dashboard'` | `"farmer-dashboard/"` |
| Delivery Dashboard | `delivery_dashboard_view` | `'delivery_dashboard'` | `"delivery-dashboard/"` |
| Admin Dashboard | `admin_dashboard_view` | `'admin_dashboard'` | `"admin-dashboard/"` |
| Traceability | `traceability_view` | `'traceability'` | `"traceability/"` |
| Notifications | `notifications_view` | `'notifications'` | `"notifications/"` |

