## 4. Verification Plan

### Automated Checks
- Run Django system checks:
  ```powershell
  python manage.py check
  ```
- Run tests verifying HTTP 200 OK responses for all routes and proper template rendering:
  ```powershell
  python manage.py test
  ```

### Manual Verification
- Start local development server:
  ```powershell
  python manage.py runserver
  ```
- Navigate through all 10 pages in the browser to verify full page flow and visual appearance.
